            "review_title": "Review at Yeebo Seafood & Hot Pot Restaurant",
            "review_text": "R K L\nSeattle, Washington4244 contributions\n0\nChinese dining in a luxurious setting...\nJan 2020\nWe found ourselves overnight during the Chinese New Year weekend in Ho Chi Minh City and in search of a decent restaurant for dinner. Yeebo Seafood & Hot Pot Restaurant looked quite inviting from street level and ended up being an excellent random choice. Finding out that they also served a Max Reserva Chilean white wine was definitely a plus. Our family-style dishes consisted of Chinese Mushrooms with Vegetables, a Steamed Chicken, Fried Flat Rice Noodles with Beef and steamed rice. This was fine Chinese dining in a luxurious setting, impeccable service and amazingly delicious food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 25, 2020",
